 ### Added
 
+- Session authentication with Livewire full-page login and registration, password reset, e-mail verification, logout, and a verified `/home` area.
+- Brazilian Portuguese UI (`pt_BR`) with English fallback and translation files for every screen text.
+- Login/registration rate limiting, signed and throttled verification links, and the app-wide password defaults (8+ characters with letters, mixed case, and numbers).
 - Database schema and Mermaid diagram in [`docs/database-schema.md`](docs/database-schema.md).
 - Business rules documentation in [`docs/business-rules.md`](docs/business-rules.md): MVP queue management, entity/subscription, roles (admin, owner, employee), tickets, priorities, fairness (3-ticket rule), deterministic call panel, and channels (Flutter totem, web TV, attendant).
 - This changelog (Keep a Changelog).
